### Créer un abonnement
POST {{base_path}}{{port}}/subscriptions
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

{
  "organizationId": "{{orgId}}",
  "userId": "{{userId}}",
  "amount": 50000,
  "currency": "XAF"
}

### Récupérer l'abonnement actif
GET {{base_path}}{{port}}/subscriptions/active/{{orgId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Récupérer tous les abonnements (admin)
GET {{base_path}}{{port}}/subscriptions
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Avec filtres
GET {{base_path}}{{port}}/subscriptions?organizationId={{orgId}}&isActive=true&page=1&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}